        "description": "__Height:__ 177 cm (5'10\"); 179 cm (5'10\")\n__Swim Style:__ Butterfly (specialty), breaststroke, individual medley\n\nThe rival swimmer from Sametsuka Academy.  Rin Matsuoka is [Haruka](https://anilist.co/character/83023/Nanase-Haruka)'s rival who is also in 11th grade. He had gone abroad to study swimming, but his personality changed immensely by the time he had returned to Japan and for this reason he often perplexes his former teammates.\n\nRin goes to all-boys school.\n\n",
        "gender": "Male",
