        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 175 cm (5'9\"); 177 cm (5'10\")\n__Swim Style:__ Freestyle\n\nFreestyle swimmer (crawl) of the Iwatobi High School swimming team. Haruka Nanase is an 11th grader who loves to swim. His strong and quiet swimming style fascinates many, and he holds a strong fixation on freestyle swimming.\n\nHis best friends include [Makoto Tachibana](https://anilist.co/character/83027/Tachibana-Makoto) & [Nagisa Hazuki](https://anilist.co/character/83021/Hazuki-Nagisa) from Grade School, then he later befriends [Rei Ryuugazaki](https://anilist.co/character/83025/Ryuugazaki-Rei). He used to be best friends with [Rin Matsuoka](https://anilist.co/character/83019/Matsuoka-Rin), but now Rin has become Haruka's rival. Haruka has created the Iwatobi High School Swimming Club along with his other friends to take down Rin.  \n\n",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": "17-19"
      },
