        "description": "__Height:__ 165 cm (5'5\"); 167 cm (5'6\")\n__Swim Style:__ Breastroke (Specialty)\n\nBreaststroke swimmer of the Iwatobi High School swimming team. [Haruka's](https://anilist.co/character/83023/Nanase-Haruka) kouhai and a first year. He is a straight-forward person and his actions are faster than his words. He admires Haruka's swimming; it's the reason for him to start swimming. He enters Iwatobi High School because Haruka is there.",
