        "description": "__Height:__ 177 cm (5'10\")\n__Swimming style:__ Butterfly stroke\n\nA freshman who joins the Iwatobi High School swim team.\n\nRei Ryuugazaki is a classmate of [Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/83021/Hazuki-Nagisa)'s in 10th grade. He was originally a member of the track team, but decided to join the swimming club instead. A handsome, intelligent young man who often gets manipulated by [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/83019/Matsuoka-Rin) for some reason.\n\n(Source: ANN)",
